* ==============================================================================
* sfs-stepper-power-spice: power stage models (ngspice)
*
* File:        models/l6387_behav.lib
* Description: L6387E high- and low-side gate driver, behavioural model.
*              Datasheet (VCC = 15 V, 25 degC): ton 110 ns, toff 105 ns, source
*              400 mA, sink 650 mA, interlocking (HIN and LIN high -> both
*              outputs low, no internal dead time), bootstrap DMOS 125 Ohm,
*              input thresholds 1.5 / 3.6 V (modelled as one 2.5 V threshold).
*              Delays: lossless lines (no XSPICE needed); output stages: smooth
*              conductances, resistances VCC / I of the short-circuit currents.
*
* Author:      Anton Vynohradov
* Email:       avynohradov@systemfromscratch.com
* License:     Apache License 2.0
* Copyright:   (c) 2026 Anton Vynohradov
*
* SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
* ==============================================================================

* pins: hin lin vcc gnd boot hvg out lvg
.subckt L6387_BEHAV hin lin vcc gnd boot hvg out lvg params: ton=110n toff=105n
+ rsrc=30 rsnk=18 rboot=125
* interlock: logic levels 0 / 1, smooth thresholds at 2.5 V (keeps the solver robust)
BH hl gnd V = 0.25 * (1 + tanh((V(hin, gnd) - 2.5) / 0.05)) * (1 - tanh((V(lin, gnd) - 2.5) / 0.05))
BL ll gnd V = 0.25 * (1 + tanh((V(lin, gnd) - 2.5) / 0.05)) * (1 - tanh((V(hin, gnd) - 2.5) / 0.05))
* propagation delay: matched lossless line, average of ton and toff (the 5 ns
* difference is neglected); RC of 5 ns shapes the internal edge
T1 hl gnd hd0 gnd Z0=50 TD={(ton + toff) / 2}
RT1 hd0 gnd 50
RHD hd0 hd 1k
CHD hd gnd 5p
T2 ll gnd ld0 gnd Z0=50 TD={(ton + toff) / 2}
RT2 ld0 gnd 50
RLD ld0 ld 1k
CLD ld gnd 5p
* output stages: conductances hd / rsrc to the supply and (1 - hd) / rsnk to the
* reference (the gate charge is taken from the bootstrap capacitor / VCC)
BHS boot hvg I = V(hd, gnd) * V(boot, hvg) / {rsrc}
BHK hvg out I = (1 - V(hd, gnd)) * V(hvg, out) / {rsnk}
BLS vcc lvg I = V(ld, gnd) * V(vcc, lvg) / {rsrc}
BLK lvg gnd I = (1 - V(ld, gnd)) * V(lvg, gnd) / {rsnk}
RHL hvg out 1Meg
RLL lvg gnd 1Meg
* output capacitance of the driver stages (keeps the output nodes dynamic)
CHO hvg out 20p
CLO lvg gnd 20p
* bootstrap: DMOS (125 Ohm) in series with a diode
RBOOT vcc bd {rboot}
DBOOT bd boot DB
.model DB D IS=1e-14 N=1
.ends L6387_BEHAV
